# Conformance probe pack for the `hex` transform (spec 0.22, Fields longer
# than 64 bits) on a fixed layout, bit order msb-lsb, high-bit-first positions and low-bit-first values (0.22).
# Public. No kinds. The same lines as the packs `conformance-long-hex-lsb`,
# `-msb` and `-mlsb`, so one input shows the digits each order gives.
#
#   bits 0..15    label  four hex digits; digit k is the 4-bit field at bit 4k
#   bits 18..25   tag    two hex digits at an offset that is not a multiple of 4
#                        (bits 16, 17 and 26 to 31 are mapped by no line)
format     conformance-long-hex-mlsb
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
word_bytes 1
bit_order  msb-lsb
field   probe.label  0:0:16  hex
field   probe.tag    0:18:8  hex
